{
 "_meta": {
  "description": "Controlled vocabulary of effect types for the NP KB. Item/mastery/sign/race effects reference these keys. delivery classes: constant (always-on while equipped/owned), on-strike (cast when strikes), on-use (cast when used), timed (fixed duration), triggered-spell (grants a castable spell/power), skill-only (fortifies a skill; does not move computed HP/MP/AR/resists), unmodeled (server-custom effect with unknown mechanics).",
  "conventions": [
   "Stacking: every effect key in this vocabulary stacks FLAT ADDITIVE except 'absorb' (Spell Absorption) and 'reflect' (Spell Reflect), the game's only two multiplicative effects (total = 1 - product(1 - each)). 'sanc' (Sanctuary) is additive and is NOT Spell Absorption — never fold it into the absorption roll."
  ]
 },
